  "about": {
    "title": "About the Champion's Path set",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Pokémon TCG: Champion's Path is a Sword & Shield expansion released on 25 September 2020. It has 80 cards: 73 in the main set and 7 secret rares. There are also 54 reverse holos.",
      "Choose what you’re collecting: the <b>Standard set</b> (the 73 main set cards), the <b>Master set</b> (127 cards, adding the reverse holos) or the <b>Grand Master set</b> (all 134 cards, adding the 7 secret rares).",
      "This free checklist lets you tick off the cards you own, count spare copies for trading, see your progress by rarity and plan your binder pages. It works on phones and computers, even offline, and your collection stays on your device."
